# What the image build does not need. The context is addons/cma, and the build reads only the module's Go packages.
# livecheck is a module of its own that imports the root module, so the image must not need it; kind holds the
# example's kind values.
livecheck
kind
*.md
**/*.test
# At any depth: a pattern without **/ matches only at the root of the context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/kubeconfig*
# A local run's SQLite store (SQLITE_PATH defaults to a file in the working directory) and its journal files.
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
